//! Pin assignment for the Vectrex programmer board (RP2354B).
//!
//! GENERATED from programmer.kicad_pcb by tools/genpins.py - do not edit by hand.
//! Every constant here was read out of the routed board, so it cannot drift from
//! the hardware.
//!
//! The cartridge bus signals are deliberately NOT contiguous: the pin map was
//! chosen so the buses run without crossings between the RP2354B, the level
//! shifters and the edge connector. Scattering bits into GPIO positions is
//! therefore done with the lookup tables at the bottom of this file rather than
//! with shifts.

